sourceArguments."bulkBranchAliasRefinement" -> sourceArguments."bulkForeignWriteCustody": "Bulk/native custody consumes actual target/caller chains, canonical alias classes, rooted staging write ownership and directional progress; generated source alone does not grant native admission"
