sourceArguments."wholeWorkPublication" -> sourceArguments."acceptedRoundSimulation": "The accepted round can abstract settleCopy/closeProducers only after every covered private, published, claimed and phase-descendant obligation closes"
sourceArguments."parkReloadBorrow" -> sourceArguments."acceptedRoundSimulation": "The C-to-QNT close/park relation requires data-access quiescence and reload, not merely a surviving RC lifetime borrow"
sourceArguments."stillStrongClosure" -> sourceArguments."acceptedRoundSimulation": "Whole finish cannot be inferred until supplemental strong still and downstream producers close"
sourceArguments."preRegistrationLoan" -> sourceArguments."parkReloadBorrow": "Installed target root and surviving source loan precede reliance on the borrowed canonical slot; no ACK from mere node membership"
